WEBVTT

00:03.216 --> 00:05.257
Welcome to the Engine Room Records

00:05.337 --> 00:08.197
Planetarium, and our presentation of

00:08.317 --> 00:11.418
Sanctuary. Having established our initial

00:11.478 --> 00:15.119
tidal lock, our trajectory now brings us to the

00:15.159 --> 00:19.600
periapsis. This is the point in our orbit

00:19.660 --> 00:22.020
closest to the parent body, where

00:22.060 --> 00:25.281
gravitational pull is strongest, and our

00:25.321 --> 00:29.055
velocity reaches its absolute maximum. Please

00:29.115 --> 00:33.217
remain seated as we initiate the orbital

00:33.417 --> 00:34.637
slingshot maneuver.

